<http://data.silknow.org/event/06b5987d-0499-3142-b716-0227b2c705da>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Purchased from Monsieur Vitall Benguiat, Savile Row.\n\nThis altar frontal together with the chasuble (935-1901) are said to have come from Sawston Hall, Cambridgeshire, the seat of the Catholic family of Huddlestone."@en ;
